---
layout: base.njk
navKey: press
title: Press Kit
metaTitle: "Press Kit | Phi Gallery, Watertown NY"
description: "Press kit for Phi Gallery — boilerplate, fact sheet, coordinators, and media contact. A DIY community art space and live music venue in downtown Watertown, NY."
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Home
    url: /
  - label: Press
---
{#- Derive rosters from data so the kit never goes stale when the roster changes. -#}
{%- set coordList %}{% for c in collections.artistsCoordinators %}{{ c.data.title }}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %}, and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset -%}
{%- set coordDots %}{% for c in collections.artistsCoordinators %}{{ c.data.title }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset -%}
{%- set residentList %}{% for p in collections.partnersResidents %}{{ p.data.title }}{% if not loop.last %}{% if loop.revindex0 == 1 %}, and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset -%}
{%- set residentDots %}{% for p in collections.partnersResidents %}{{ p.data.title }}{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endset -%}
<section class="section wrap-narrow">
  <header class="stack" style="margin-bottom: var(--sp-5);">
    <p class="kicker">For journalists &amp; partners</p>
    <h1 class="display" style="font-size: var(--fs-3xl);">Press Kit</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything you need to cover Phi Gallery. For hi-res originals or interviews, reach <a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a>.</p>
    <div class="cluster">
      {%- if settings.pressKitUrl %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ settings.pressKitUrl }}" rel="noopener" data-analytics="press-download">Download press kit (ZIP)</a>
      {%- elif presskit.assets.length %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#assets" data-analytics="press-download">Download assets ↓</a>
      {%- else %}
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}?subject=Phi%20Gallery%20press%20assets" data-analytics="press-download">Request hi-res assets</a>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </header>

  {%- if presskit.assets.length %}
  <div class="section-head" id="assets"><h2>Brand &amp; photo assets</h2></div>
  <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);">Cleared for editorial use covering Phi Gallery. Please credit photographers where noted.</p>
  <div class="grid grid--3">
    {%- for a in presskit.assets %}
    <figure class="panel" style="margin:0;">
      <div style="background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1rem; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; aspect-ratio:4/3; overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="{{ a.file }}" alt="{{ a.label }}" style="max-width:100%; max-height:100%; width:auto; height:auto; background:none;" eleventy:widths="300,600" sizes="320px">
      </div>
      <figcaption style="font-size:var(--fs-sm); margin-top:.6rem;">{{ a.label }}{% if a.credit %} <span class="faint">— {{ a.credit }}</span>{% endif %}</figcaption>
      <p style="margin-top:.5rem;"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" href="{{ a.file }}" download>Download ↓</a></p>
    </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>One-liner</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a DIY community art space and live music venue on Public Square in downtown Watertown, NY.</p>

    <h2>Short boilerplate</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a community art space in the heart of downtown Watertown, NY. Opened in {{ settings.founded }} by {{ settings.founder }}, the gallery hosts visual art exhibits, live music, literary arts workshops, sound healing, and a rotating collective of local artisanal vendors. Phi Gallery is coordinated by {{ coordList | trim }}.</p>

    <h2>Full boilerplate</h2>
    <p>Phi Gallery is a community art space opened in {{ settings.founded }} by {{ settings.founder }} on Public Square in downtown Watertown, NY. Built by artists, for artists, the gallery is home to visual arts and exhibits, musical artists and events, literary arts professionals and workshops, sound healing, and more — a DIY hub where the North Country's creative community gathers, shows work, and plays shows.</p>
    <p>Phi Gallery also houses a collective of local makers and organizations, including {{ residentList | trim }}, and a handful of incredible local artisanal vendors.</p>
    <p>The gallery is located at {{ settings.address.street }}, {{ settings.address.city }}, {{ settings.address.region }} {{ settings.address.postalCode }}, and is coordinated by {{ coordList | trim }}.</p>

    <h2>Fact sheet</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Name</th><td>{{ settings.name }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>What</th><td>Community art gallery · live music venue · workshop space · vendor collective</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Founded</th><td>{{ settings.founded }}, by {{ settings.founder }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Address</th><td>{{ settings.address.street }}, {{ settings.address.city }}, {{ settings.address.region }} {{ settings.address.postalCode }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Coordinators</th><td>{{ coordDots | trim }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Programs</th><td>Visual art exhibits · live music &amp; events · literary arts workshops · sound healing · local artisan market</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Residents</th><td>{{ residentDots | trim }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Website</th><td>{{ site.url | replace('https://','') }}</td></tr>
      {% if settings.instagram %}<tr><th>Instagram</th><td>@{{ settings.instagram | replace('@','') }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
      <tr><th>Press contact</th><td><a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a></td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2>The people</h2>
    <ul>
      {%- for c in collections.artistsCoordinators %}
      <li><strong>{{ c.data.title }}</strong> — {% if c.data.title == settings.founder %}Founder &amp; coordinator{% else %}Coordinator{% endif %}.</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2>Usage</h2>
    <p>The logos and photos above are cleared for editorial use covering Phi Gallery. Please credit photographers where captioned. For interviews or anything you can't find here, reach <a href="mailto:{{ settings.pressEmail }}">{{ settings.pressEmail }}</a>.</p>
  </div>

  {%- if collections.pressSorted.length %}
  <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: var(--sp-6);"><h2>In the press</h2></div>
  <div>
    {%- for m in collections.pressSorted %}
    <article class="event-row" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;">
      <div class="event-row__body">
        <h3 class="event-row__title" style="font-size: var(--fs-base);">
          {% if m.data.url %}<a href="{{ m.data.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ m.data.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ m.data.title }}{% endif %}
        </h3>
        <p class="event-row__meta"><span>{{ m.data.outlet }}</span><span>{{ m.data.date | readableDate("LLL d, yyyy") }}</span></p>
      </div>
      {% if m.data.url %}<div class="event-row__cta"><a class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" href="{{ m.data.url }}" rel="noopener">Read ↗</a></div>{% endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
